        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Galaxy Realm! Meet Shimmer, a happy, quirky lizard. She's part of a tribe of fellow lizards dedicated to battling Void creatures and eating lots of sushi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After accidentally destroying the sacred flower that protects the village against the Void, she is now shunned by most of her community. She sets out on a mission to restore the rare magical flower. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Shimmer on her quest in this silly point-and-click adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point, click,   waddle and whoop your way around a uniquely hand-painted fantasy world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with your fellow villagers and search for items to solve puzzles and fulfil your quest </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet strange creatures and make new friends </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the culture and lore of the Shimmer tribe and their allies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover some of the deep, life-changing Shimmer wisdoms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect rare items, hidden in the Realm to brighten your garden </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute, unique anthropomorphic designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax to a beautiful, original soundtrack </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
